{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resource extraction: In Forest Construction VR, several basic sources of construction materials are available, such as trees, stones, and clay. You will be able to use various tools to gather them, then divide the collected materials into parts, process them, and use them in construction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/71d7bee4a221e2b9ddf9fb633df2e509.poster.avif?t=1750359649\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/71d7bee4a221e2b9ddf9fb633df2e509.webm?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/71d7bee4a221e2b9ddf9fb633df2e509.mp4?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting: The gathered resources can be processed at workstations into various construction elements, such as bricks, planks, beams, and other building components.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/be7e55195623cabbceb244afcbd8c93b.poster.avif?t=1750359649\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/be7e55195623cabbceb244afcbd8c93b.webm?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/be7e55195623cabbceb244afcbd8c93b.mp4?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Construction: The construction mechanic allows you to place an object at any angle and in any location, enabling you to build a wide variety of structures such as houses, towers, bridges, and anything else you can imagine using the materials you have gathered and processed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/1f0394eed7d916916265ec20450c4bc7.poster.avif?t=1750359649\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/1f0394eed7d916916265ec20450c4bc7.webm?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/1f0394eed7d916916265ec20450c4bc7.mp4?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interactivity: Forest Construction VR offers players excellent physical interactivity. Players will need to carry, transport, lift, and hold tools and construction materials, which have the necessary physical properties for realistic interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/af3169775954b99dee7dfec2d33b95e0.poster.avif?t=1750359649\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/af3169775954b99dee7dfec2d33b95e0.webm?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/extras/af3169775954b99dee7dfec2d33b95e0.mp4?t=1750359649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sandbox gameplay without survival: Forest Construction VR does not limit you to survival, but invites you to immerse yourself in the creative process of construction and experimentation without unnecessary restrictions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These key mechanics will help you create unique structures, enjoy the building process, and immerse yourself in the cozy atmosphere of the forest world of the game. Use these opportunities to have a great time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2989140?t=1750359649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/0504aed30764b138d9eef1135edc5baf77d2cd53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750359649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/b30ab4dcdd4e9fd8aa697c590963c2c976bf5318/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750359649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989140/b30ab4dcdd4e9fd8aa697c590963c2c976bf5318/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750359649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3221550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resource extraction: In Forest Construction VR, several basic sources of construction materials are available, such as trees, stones, and clay. You will be able to use various tools to gather them, then divide the collected materials into parts, process them, and use them in construction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 